<speak>
<s>This is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">08062026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>Israel struck the Dahiyeh district of southern Beirut on Sunday, and within hours Iran launched ballistic missiles at Israeli air bases.</s> <s>Iran's parliament speaker declared US bases and Israeli assets legitimate targets, while Brent crude pushed above ninety-five dollars a barrel.</s> <s>Trump said he was not happy and had ordered the strikes halted... yet Israel struck anyway, and a patron unable to restrain its client now watches the war widen.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>In India, police in Uttar Pradesh shot dead a wanted man, Bhanu Pratap Singh, before he ever stood trial.</s> <s>He carried forty pending cases and a bounty on his head, but no court tested the charges, and the state has opened no independent inquiry into the killing.</s> <s>These so-called encounters have numbered in the thousands since two thousand seventeen, where a police shooting quietly replaces a verdict.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Ukraine's president sent the sanctioned billionaire Roman Abramovich to Moscow in May, carrying a proposal for a summit with Putin.</s> <s>Abramovich is the only Russian that Kyiv has ever used as an intermediary, and Putin rejected the overture, saying he saw no point.</s> <s>That a wartime president routes peace through a sanctioned oligarch reveals just how blocked the formal track has become.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Off Malta, a boat carrying nearly sixty people capsized forty-five miles from shore, and ten bodies were recovered while forty-eight survived.</s> <s>The European Union has paid Libya seven hundred million euros since two thousand fifteen to block these crossings, yet the central Mediterranean remains the world's deadliest migration route.</s> <s>More than eight hundred people have drowned on it this year alone.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>South Africa's president, Cyril Ramaphosa, announced prison terms for employers of undocumented workers as anti-foreigner marches set a deadline of the thirtieth of June.</s> <s>More than a thousand Nigerians have already registered to be repatriated, and hiring quotas now sort jobs by nationality.</s> <s>When mass unemployment is recoded as a foreigner problem, the state's frustration finds a target it can punish.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Nigeria's army freed three hundred sixty people from a Boko Haram camp in the Mandara Mountains, though two infants had already died in captivity.</s> <s>The captives were seized by a kidnap economy that takes whole communities for ransom or forced labour across the northeast.</s> <s>The army called the raid a major operational success... but the camps that still hold the others remain.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Xi Jinping landed in Pyongyang, his first visit in seven years, to rebuild the influence China lost as North Korea drew closer to Russia.</s> <s>He'll offer food aid and tourism deals without pressing Kim Jong Un to give up nuclear weapons.</s> <s>Whether Beijing can pull Pyongyang back from Moscow's orbit is the quiet contest beneath the handshakes.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>OPEC raised its July production quotas to levels it simply cannot deliver.</s> <s>The Strait of Hormuz has been closed since February, and the group's output has fallen from nearly forty-three million barrels a day to just thirty-three.</s> <s>When Hormuz reopens, analysts warn, the market could swing from fear of shortage to fear of glut overnight.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The White House has drafted a plan to buy the Chagos Islands directly from Mauritius, bypassing Britain, the former colonial holder.</s> <s>The archipelago hosts the Diego Garcia military base, and the purchase would void a deal that London had already struck.</s> <s>Treating sovereignty as a purchasable asset, the plan again subordinates the displaced Chagossians' right to return to a military bargain.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Pakistan arrested a member of its own oil-and-gas regulator over fourteen billion rupees in questionable pricing claims.</s> <s>The government now plans to install civil servants atop a body meant to stay independent, just as fuel prices are most fiercely contested.</s> <s>When the referee is hollowed out under investigation, the question becomes who sets the price ordinary consumers pay.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>A magnitude seven point eight earthquake struck off Mindanao at dawn, killing at least five people in General Santos.</s> <s>The Pacific Tsunami Warning Centre warned of three-metre waves, and small surges reached as far as Indonesia.</s> <s>The Philippines sits on the Ring of Fire, where the same megathrust that shook it threatens its neighbours too.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Astronomers in Australia traced a repeating radio signal to a pair of stars spiralling around each other.</s> <s>The source defied the neutron-star models long used to explain such bursts, earning it the name of a Rosetta stone.</s> <s>Exactly how an orbiting binary produces the rhythm is a puzzle still unsolved.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A drug called survodutide cut liver fat by fifty-nine percent in a phase-three trial, against just ten for placebo.</s> <s>It targets two receptors at once, acting on the liver directly rather than only curbing appetite.</s> <s>Whether regulators clear it, and how soon, the makers wouldn't say.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>British researchers unveiled a platform that inserts yield, drought, and disease genes into a crop in a single step.</s> <s>Conventional breeding stacks such traits one generation at a time, a process that can take decades.</s> <s>By compressing that into one move, the tool could reshape how fast the world's farms adapt to a warming climate.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Researchers in Tokyo built a single reinforcement-learning model that reproduces how habits form in the brain.</s> <s>The dominant theory needs two separate brain systems to explain it, yet one system here did the same work.</s> <s>The same mathematics that trains artificial agents may now describe how living brains learn their routines.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In the United States, the House Ways and Means Committee released seven bills to tax cryptocurrency.</s> <s>They'd decide whether everyday transactions trigger capital-gains reporting or qualify for a cash-like exemption below a threshold.</s> <s>How that line is drawn will shape whether digital money behaves like cash or like an investment.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>